    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43976" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθεώρητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easily seen</i> or
				<i>observed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				578a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.1.1
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easy to perceive</i>, <i><span class="en">
