				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				724a17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔστιν εὐ. ποτέρως</span>
			. . <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>SE</u>
				180b3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνες εἰσὶ καὶ πόσαι</span> .
			. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Comm.Math.</u>
				24
			</span></i>: c. acc. et inf., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1251.7
			</span></i>.</div>
